      "content": "That's an interesting take on the fiscal and structural issues. You mentioned that economists \"universally agree\" on the inflationary pressure and budgetary strain. To help my readers understand the nuances of the debate, could you clarify if there are any credible, mainstream economic models or peer-reviewed studies that actually support the idea that UBI could be part of a stable fiscal framework, or is the consensus truly as one-sided as you suggest?",
